<title>USA: DiaSys suspends Intelligent Medical pact.</title>
<headline>DiaSys suspends Intelligent Medical pact.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Conn. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DiaSys Corp said Wednesday it had notified Intelligent Medical Imaging Inc that it was suspending its participation in a product integration agreement between the two companies, pending rsolution of certain disputes between them..</p>
<p>DiaSys said representatives of the two companies are to meet shortly in an attempt to resolve the disputes.</p>
<p>DiaSys did not specify what the disputes were about.</p>
</text>
